---
// Ordered, numbered how-to steps. Wraps <Step> children in an <ol>; the green circle
// badges auto-number via a CSS counter, so authors just list <Step title="…"> blocks.
---

<ol class="help-steps"><slot /></ol>

<style>
  .help-steps {
    counter-reset: help-step;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
</style>
